(7652276, 1244980, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MichaelC:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the RED - are you sure it was shot with a tampon? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL.  That is a typo I''ve made in the past. I need to be more careful!  Adds a little humor.</td>', 'Originally posted by MichaelC: Congrats on the RED - are you sure it was shot with a tampon?  LOL.  That is a typo I''ve made in the past. I need to be more careful!  Adds a little humor.', '2020-01-31 05:48:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652277, 1244980, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ammie:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on the red </i></td></tr></table> Thank you<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Ammie: Congratulations on the red  Thank you', '2020-01-31 05:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652278, 1244980, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> A nod to the Renaissance and great use of the border </i></td></tr></table>Thank you - I also liked the mood of this photo</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: A nod to the Renaissance and great use of the border Thank you - I also liked the mood of this photo', '2020-01-31 05:49:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652279, 1244980, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moszi:</b></div><hr/><i> Good photo, though I would probably choose the unedited version :) ... </i></td></tr></table>Thank you - the girl on the right had quite a few blemishes but in total her skin was almost porcelain like so I diced to smooth it out and get rid of the imperfections.</td>', 'Originally posted by moszi: Good photo, though I would probably choose the unedited version :) ... Thank you - the girl on the right had quite a few blemishes but in total her skin was almost porcelain like so I diced to smooth it out and get rid of the imperfections.', '2020-01-31 05:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652280, 1244980, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jomari:</b></div><hr/><i> Both versions are beautiful and bring to mind Renaissance painting. The ''cosmetic surgery'' on the girl on the right (of the picture) was probably not necessary. Top 3. </i></td></tr></table> Thank you - the girl on the right had quite a few blemishes but in total her skin was almost porcelain like so I diced to smooth it out and get rid of the imperfections.</td>', 'Originally posted by jomari: Both versions are beautiful and bring to mind Renaissance painting. The ''cosmetic surgery'' on the girl on the right (of the picture) was probably not necessary. Top 3.  Thank you - the girl on the right had quite a few blemishes but in total her skin was almost porcelain like so I diced to smooth it out and get rid of the imperfections.', '2020-01-31 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652281, 1245106, 251422, '<td valign="top">So creative - worth of a blue</td>', 'So creative - worth of a blue', '2020-01-31 05:51:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652282, 1245118, 251422, '<td valign="top">Loved twos photo.  just took a portrait of my husband in a cowboy hat...adds such character.</td>', 'Loved twos photo.  just took a portrait of my husband in a cowboy hat...adds such character.', '2020-01-31 05:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652283, 1244921, 251422, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait and very nice editing.</td>', 'Very nice portrait and very nice editing.', '2020-01-31 05:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652284, 1244980, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ammie:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on the red </i></td></tr></table> Thank you!</td>', 'Originally posted by Ammie: Congratulations on the red  Thank you!', '2020-01-31 05:54:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652285, 1245117, 251422, '<td valign="top">I think adding texture to a male portrait is a nice effect.  I like my skin smoothed but never really works on men.  Nice job.</td>', 'I think adding texture to a male portrait is a nice effect.  I like my skin smoothed but never really works on men.  Nice job.', '2020-01-31 05:56:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652287, 1244980, 16912, '<td valign="top">Yup, Renaissance  style it is and an excellent before and after shot. I know lots of people ''think'' there should be a good seperation between background and hair but this shot obviously doesn''t need it.</td>', 'Yup, Renaissance  style it is and an excellent before and after shot. I know lots of people ''think'' there should be a good seperation between background and hair but this shot obviously doesn''t need it.', '2020-01-31 06:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652294, 1245106, 113411, '<td valign="top">Congratulations..so well done!</td>', 'Congratulations..so well done!', '2020-01-31 08:56:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652295, 1245106, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the well-deserved blue.  Fine tinkering with light, both obvious and subtle.  A good case can be made for the quality of the original, as might be expected, but blacking out the background is a key to the final superb result.</td>', 'Congrats on the well-deserved blue.  Fine tinkering with light, both obvious and subtle.  A good case can be made for the quality of the original, as might be expected, but blacking out the background is a key to the final superb result.', '2020-01-31 08:57:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652296, 1244980, 113411, '<td valign="top">Hey Susan!!! Congratulations...another ribbon! Great work!</td>', 'Hey Susan!!! Congratulations...another ribbon! Great work!', '2020-01-31 08:57:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652297, 1245118, 113411, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Mark..well done!</td>', 'Congratulations, Mark..well done!', '2020-01-31 08:58:42.000000', NULL, 0),
