(7652299, 1244980, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ecce_Signum:</b></div><hr/><i> Yup, Renaissance  style it is and an excellent before and after shot. I know lots of people ''think'' there should be a good seperation between background and hair but this shot obviously doesn''t need it. </i></td></tr></table> I agree - I thought a light in the background would have been a real distraction.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Ecce_Signum: Yup, Renaissance  style it is and an excellent before and after shot. I know lots of people ''think'' there should be a good seperation between background and hair but this shot obviously doesn''t need it.  I agree - I thought a light in the background would have been a real distraction.', '2020-01-31 09:01:41.000000', NULL, 0),
